      "pos": [
        31,
        1
      ],
      "data": {
        "text": "One oscillator bends another inside the picture.\nOscillator 1 (left) draws soft grey rows. Its picture goes into FM IN on oscillator 2. Oscillator 2 draws about 20 bars across the picture. Where oscillator 1 is bright, the bars bunch together. Where it is dark, they spread apart. So the bars bend with the shape of the rows.\nOscillator 1's LOCK A is a little below full, so its rows drift and the bend rolls down the picture.\nTry FM AMT on oscillator 2: negative reverses which parts bunch. Try FREQ A on either oscillator, and LOCK A on oscillator 1 (all the way up stops the roll).\nThe Colorizer paints the grey bars. The Display shows the Colorizer."
      }
    }
